    "detailed_description": "<strong>'Today my husband was not my husband.'</strong><br><br>The love story is a Tzukur adventure about a strange event that takes place around the main character Mira.<br><br>Nine years ago, Mira was a high school girl who lost her boyfriend, Jaewon, in a tragic accident.<br><br>But time slowly washed away the mummy's wounds, as did everything in the world.<br><br>Nine years later, Mira did what she wanted and married someone who loved her and lived a satisfying life.<br><br>Until history changes for unknown reasons.<br><br>In a changed history, you have to make the most important choice of her life with a mummy who is embarrassed by strangers and events.<br><br>What kind of story is hidden in Mira?<br><br>And how does your choice lead the mummy to an end?<br><br><strong>This isn't a romance, but it's a clear [love story] anyway.</strong><br><br>[Love Story] is a simple Tzukur story game with a high proportion of events.<br><br>Depending on your choice within the game, the storyline in the middle, as well as the various endings, changes.<br><br>Some objects show slightly different stories depending on the number or order of selection.<br><br>The playtime of each game is not long, but you need to make a careful decision to see the whole story because you take the choice to the end without saving it.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>'Today my husband was not my husband.'</strong><br><br>The love story is a Tzukur adventure about a strange event that takes place around the main character Mira.<br><br>Nine years ago, Mira was a high school girl who lost her boyfriend, Jaewon, in a tragic accident.<br><br>But time slowly washed away the mummy's wounds, as did everything in the world.<br><br>Nine years later, Mira did what she wanted and married someone who loved her and lived a satisfying life.<br><br>Until history changes for unknown reasons.<br><br>In a changed history, you have to make the most important choice of her life with a mummy who is embarrassed by strangers and events.<br><br>What kind of story is hidden in Mira?<br><br>And how does your choice lead the mummy to an end?<br><br><strong>This isn't a romance, but it's a clear [love story] anyway.</strong><br><br>[Love Story] is a simple Tzukur story game with a high proportion of events.<br><br>Depending on your choice within the game, the storyline in the middle, as well as the various endings, changes.<br><br>Some objects show slightly different stories depending on the number or order of selection.<br><br>The playtime of each game is not long, but you need to make a careful decision to see the whole story because you take the choice to the end without saving it.",
